Looks great, doesn't it?

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:51.730
Yes...

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:54.060
It's wonderful...

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:55.310
Hey, Momoko-chan.

00:01:55.660 --> 00:01:56.000
Yes?

00:01:56.410 --> 00:01:58.700
What do you think of my costume?

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:06.650
Hey, these props are nothing to be afraid of.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:11.170
I didn't think they could be so scary...

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:15.280
In that case,

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:20.050
our class will be doing a haunted house during this year's school festival.

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:26.240
Guys, are you sure?

00:02:26.610 --> 00:02:29.380
Which idiot voted for the haunted house?

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:32.770
I didn't think anyone else would vote for it, so I did it as a joke...

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:34.150
Same here...

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:35.310
I couldn't help myself...

00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:38.610
A haunted house...

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:40.430
Kya~ I'm scared.

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:43.100
You are hopeless.

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:47.840
It's a little different than what I have planned...

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:51.570
But I hope things will turn out as I have expected.

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:55.840
Hey, could you get off of me?

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:56.440
Eh?

00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:59.360
No...

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:04.100
Are you okay?

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:06.020
The sandal strap...

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:12.890
Could this be Yazawa-san's curse?

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:16.470
We shouldn't have done a haunted house after all...

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:18.610
Uh... A curse...?

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:26.520
Yazawa-dono of the haunted house?

00:03:26.920 --> 00:03:27.580
That's right.

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:30.660
It's an urban legend of this school.

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:34.870
It's a ghost who haunts classes that make haunted houses during school festivals.

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:38.480
What is it this time?

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:46.610
Uh... Koushi-dono...

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:50.750
Is that person in our class?

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:52.290
Huh? What?

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:53.200
That person...

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:54.240
Huh?

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:56.910
She was just there...

00:03:57.690 --> 00:04:02.620
The Disturbance of Love in the Haunted House

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:06.700
I'm sure someone was standing right here.

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:10.970
Huh?

00:04:12.170 --> 00:04:13.200
There is no one here...

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:15.710
NO!

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:18.450
What happened, Momoko-chan?

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:25.790
The hanger got kinda rusty.

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:27.610
It just fell down on its own.

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:28.590
Eh?

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:33.920
If I don't get my act together...

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:36.340
Koushi-dono will hate me...

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:37.600
But...

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:43.370
Uh... that Whats-her-name-dono of the haunted house...

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:45.480
...is a girl...?

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:46.920
Yazawa-san?

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:50.000
I think the name is Yazawa Narumi...

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:51.600
So I guess it's a girl.

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:54.830
But why is she after classes that make haunted houses?

00:04:55.150 --> 00:05:01.400
A long time ago, Yazawa-san's class made a haunted house for the school festival as well.

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:03.060
However...

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:08.900
In an unfortunate accident, the lumbers fell down...

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:11.280
And Yazawa-san was the victim...

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:19.130
Since then, it's been rumored that Yazawa-san haunted every class that made a haunted house.

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:25.350
On top of that, it's been said that she was planning to confess her love to a boy during that festival.

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:30.400
But she died without fulfilling her dream at the end.

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:32.730
So that's what happened...

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:34.330
Momoko senpai~

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:36.620
Koushi senpai~~

00:05:35.650 --> 00:05:36.590
Hey~!

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:37.810
Iroha-dono.

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:39.290
What's with the outfit?

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:40.890
How do I look?

00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:42.050
Does it look good?

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:46.420
Our class is doing a maid tea shop.

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:48.800
You are the best, sis!

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:52.820
What is your class doing?

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:54.670
We are making a haunted house.

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:55.400
Really?

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:57.090
It sounds like fun.

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:58.690
May I take a look?

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:01.240
We are not done yet though.

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:02.330
Wha... What?

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:03.680
What's this sound?

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:06.700
It looks so realistic...

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:10.470
No one should be in the classroom right now...

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:11.000
Eh...?

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:19.790
Yo... You are...

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:21.890
...the girl who disappeared in the science room.

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:22.620
Eh?

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:25.470
No way...

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:27.200
This is not real... This is not real...

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:28.140
Sis?

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:29.840
She's unconscious!

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:32.630
Ar... Are you Yazawa-dono?

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:34.300
Of course not.

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:35.740
This is troubling...

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:37.810
You shouldn't enter someone else's classroom.

00:06:38.190 --> 00:06:38.880
What's your name?

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:39.730
Which class are you from?

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:47.320
She... She disappeared.

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:48.580
That's impossible...

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:51.310
So that was Yazawa-dono after all...?

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:53.890
Ah!

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:55.990
Is she this person?

00:06:56.590 --> 00:06:57.870
I'm not sure...

00:06:58.090 --> 00:07:00.420
But it says Yazawa Narumi...

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:02.110
So that's probably her.

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:02.870
Ah!

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:04.970
Look, Koushi-dono.

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:08.010
Amazing, he looks like your twin!

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:09.460
His name is...

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:11.190
Inuzuka... Kumoke?

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:13.160
It... It's my old man!

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:14.670
The name is actually Unken.

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:14.670
Note: The kanji for "Unken" can also be pronounced as "Kumoke".

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:16.210
Are you serious?

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:20.600
Which means... Koushi-dono will look like father in the future.

00:07:21.010 --> 00:07:22.430
No... No way...

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:24.840
Are you serious...?

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:27.040
I'm falling in love all over again!

00:07:27.100 --> 00:07:31.090
You are going to become even more handsome than now.

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:35.610
What happened to her sense of beauty?

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:42.680
Could father be the person who Yazawa-dono couldn't confess her love to?

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:44.810
What are you talking about?

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:46.350
What evidence do you have?

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:48.110
It's a woman's intuition!

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:51.530
I never thought things would turn out this way...

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:54.390
I'm not Yazawa-san...

00:07:54.980 --> 00:07:55.800
At that time...

00:07:56.550 --> 00:08:00.160
I just wanted to help out...

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:16.020
I'm a part of the class too...

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:20.160
Though no one noticed my existence...

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:22.450
I'm everyone's classmate too...

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:24.020
What?

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:25.750
I have to take my old man's place?

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:26.820
Yes.

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:30.210
Koushi-dono is going to fulfill Yazawa-dono's dream!

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:34.730
If that happens, I think Yazawa-dono will finally be able to rest in peace!

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:35.700
I see!

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:37.150
Nice idea!

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:38.310
That's ridiculous.

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:42.520
Besides, we don't know if Yazawa-san really loved my old man...

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:42.040
Inuzuka-san...

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:44.150
Eh?

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.430
Yazawa-dono...

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:53.980
I can't... It's embarrassing after all...

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:55.480
Ah!

00:08:56.020 --> 00:09:00.790
I have been around machines since childhood, and just couldn't become acquainted with people.

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:04.520
Never mind having friends, people couldn't even remember my name.

00:09:04.740 --> 00:09:05.500
Hey, Kaa-kun.

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:10.500
If I pretend to be Yazawa-san, everyone will remember me, right?

00:09:10.990 --> 00:09:13.220
That's right, that's right, that's right!

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:17.180
Thank goodness.

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:21.290
I thought you were going to disappear just like earlier.

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:22.700
What happened earlier was...

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:25.720
I was so embarrassed that everyone saw me...

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:29.390
So I activated the smoke screen...

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:31.340
Yazawa-dono...

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:33.350
You are okay now?

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:35.760
You were so scared just a while ago.

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:38.590
I'm still scared...

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:41.790
But I feel sympathetic for Yazawa-dono...

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:47.350
She died without being able to express her feelings to her beloved person...

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:48.670
That's right.

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:50.770
You can't hide in the corner and shiver all the time.

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:54.730
Thank you, everyone.

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:57.020
Why are you using that to speak?

00:09:57.460 --> 00:09:59.750
Yazawa-san is a spiritual being.

00:09:59.940 --> 00:10:02.580
She can't communicate directly with this world.

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:06.530
The reality is, I can't speak out loud because I'm so embarrassed.

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:08.350
So that's why!

00:10:08.630 --> 00:10:11.430
But we are not scared!

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:14.820
What's the cheering for?

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:16.450
Inuzuka-san...

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:18.270
My beloved person...

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:19.000
Ah!

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:24.240
Do you still have feelings for father... I mean, Inuzuka Unken-dono?

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:26.500
Don't say needless things.

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:28.920
As I thought...

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:33.280
Ah~ Even death can not change love.

00:10:33.810 --> 00:10:35.670
How wonderful!

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:37.610
You are saying things that barely make any sense.

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:40.500
Inuzuka-san...

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:45.840
If you don't mind, could you spend just tomorrow, the day of the school festival, with me?

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:47.880
Wa... Wait a second...

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:48.790
With you...

00:10:49.010 --> 00:10:50.010
The two of us...?

00:10:50.860 --> 00:10:52.150
Isn't that obvious?

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:54.570
Don't you feel sorry for Yazawa-san?

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:57.360
Koushi-dono, I would like to make the same request.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:01.030
It's time to fulfill Yazawa-dono's long awaited dream.

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:02.790
That's right.

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:04.610
Do it, Inuzuka.

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:06.500
That's right.

00:11:06.650 --> 00:11:07.820
Do it already.

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:09.040
He... Hey...

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:11.050
Alright! He said okay.

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:12.810
Aren't you glad, Yazawa-san?

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:14.570
We will support you!

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:16.290
Don't make up things on your own!

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:23.480
Endurance, Momoko.

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:26.430
Koushi-dono is going to date Yazawa-dono tomorrow.

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:29.730
I can't make him change his mind!

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:33.180
Tonight's sex will have to wait until next time!

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:36.170
They've never done it...

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:44.080
Inuzuka-san...

00:11:44.170 --> 00:11:46.340
I can't wait until tomorrow!

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:02.540
If she can rest in peace after she confesses her love to me...

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:04.640
I guess I have no choice but to go through with this.

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:06.840
It's starting.

00:12:07.190 --> 00:12:09.100
I hope everything goes well.

00:12:10.610 --> 00:12:12.180
Hey, it's Yazawa-san.

00:12:13.150 --> 00:12:16.100
She died before she could confess her love.

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:20.250
The rumor has spread throughout the school...

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:23.320
It's really exciting to be the center of attention...

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:28.410
Yakisoba for two.

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:28.410
Note: That's fried noodles.

00:12:28.570 --> 00:12:30.540
Uh... Are you sure you want yakisoba?

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:31.170
Huh?

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:32.020
No.

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:34.530
I'm just not sure if ghosts can eat...

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:36.200
That's true...

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:36.980
Is it weird?

00:12:37.550 --> 00:12:38.680
Here, enjoy.

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:40.940
A... Amazing...

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:49.660
They are surprised.

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:53.930
I attached an anti-gravity device while no one was looking...

00:12:54.220 --> 00:12:56.850
Using the chopsticks is also my invention.

00:12:57.450 --> 00:12:58.960
I'm remote controlling them.

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:01.440
Do I look like a real ghost?

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:05.360
Excuse us.

00:13:05.520 --> 00:13:06.490
We are from the news club.

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:09.630
Thank you very much.

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:10.450
Huh?

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:11.230
What's wrong?

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:12.140
It's nothing...

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:16.160
I thought it was gonna turn out to be some psychic photo...

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:18.670
It's looks really normal.

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:22.100
I have to make a psychic photo...

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:25.960
Launch signal acknowledged, launch signal acknowledged.

00:13:26.270 --> 00:13:28.690
Target, Fuuunji high school airspace.

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:29.570
Launch.

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:37.610
Wha... What's happening?

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:42.750
Was fireworks scheduled in our festival?

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:44.480
But it's so pretty.

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:54.870
This is...

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:55.850
What's wrong?

00:13:57.450 --> 00:13:59.330
Ama... Amazing picture...

00:13:59.680 --> 00:14:01.810
Moreover, it's too scary...

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:09.790
Could you wait here for a while?

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:10.730
Sure...

00:14:14.340 --> 00:14:15.850
I wonder what's wrong.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.270
Ah. It's Yazawa-san.

00:14:19.520 --> 00:14:21.720
What are you doing over here?

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:25.230
It's strange for a ghost to go to the washroom after all...

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:27.780
This one is no good too.

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:37.600
Y... Y... You...!

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:40.770
I got in the mood yesterday...

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:43.760
But I can't let you have onii-chan after all!

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:45.920
Sis, quit it already.

00:14:46.050 --> 00:14:47.240
You are talking to a ghost.

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:48.400
Shut up!

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:49.600
Who cares if she's a ghost!

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:50.760
I have...

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:51.790
...this!

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:52.670
Huh?

00:14:54.590 --> 00:14:55.660
Pissing your underwear?

00:14:55.780 --> 00:15:00.110
This is the seal that was passed down in the Miyamoto family for generations to drive away evil spirits.

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:02.500
I'll send you to your next life with this.

00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:07.590
Wa... Wait...

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:08.870
It looks dangerous...

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:10.070
Prepare yourself!

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:12.420
Indara Jaei Genma style, secret technique...

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:15.250
Akuryou tokushin jourei jutsu!

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:15.250
Translation: The skill of divine purification of evil spirits.

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:28.210
Se... Senpai, why?

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:33.140
Yazawa-dono died without fulfilling her dream...

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:36.690
Please understand, Iroha-dono.

00:15:39.110 --> 00:15:41.090
But that ghost girl...

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:46.300
She's budging in, despite the fact that senpai and Koushi senpai are engaged...

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:48.370
I can't put up with it.

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:49.660
Engaged?

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:53.930
So Inuzuka-san and Momoko-san aren't cousins.

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:58.010
If I was in Yazawa-dono's shoes...

00:15:58.350 --> 00:16:02.620
If I die without expressing my love to my beloved person...

00:16:03.030 --> 00:16:07.080
I too will become a ghost and wander this world.

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:12.920
If a person who looks exactly like my beloved person appears while I'm wandering...

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:17.130
I too will follow that person like Yazawa-dono!

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:20.170
And just try to express my feelings in some way...

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:24.220
But if I was forced to reincarnate...

00:16:24.510 --> 00:16:27.610
Isn't that very depressing?

00:16:27.990 --> 00:16:29.430
Bu... But...

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:30.500
Iroha-dono...

00:16:31.100 --> 00:16:32.830
Please accept my request...

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:34.400
I beg of you.

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:36.220
Now let's go.

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:47.960
Note: It's actually a monster called "kisa no obake".

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:47.960
WA~! I'm a ghost!

00:16:48.590 --> 00:16:50.970
Are you trying to scare someone with that?

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:53.990
Moreover, there is a real one over here.

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:56.220
Don't say that...

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:58.850
I'm doing this with my sprained ankle...

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:00.390
Ghosts don't spell out their weaknesses.

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:04.850
Momoko-san, thank you for everything.

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:07.110
This is so lame, what the hell is this?

00:17:07.930 --> 00:17:10.690
What bullshit, they made a haunted house in this age.

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:13.170
Hey, try to scare me some more.

00:17:14.900 --> 00:17:16.560
Ah! It's them!

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:21.580
Hey, it looks bad, that dragon girl is here.

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:24.060
What are you guys doing!?

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:28.840
Huh? What's this? Does your ankle hurt?

00:17:29.530 --> 00:17:31.470
Let's go, don't get involved with them.

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:33.640
Stop it.

00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:35.990
Everyone made this haunted house together.

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:36.970
Yazawa-san!

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:38.070
What did you say?

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:41.460
Hey, isn't she Yazawa-san?

00:17:41.610 --> 00:17:43.030
Yo... You guys...

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:44.820
Don't go near Yazawa-san.

00:17:45.070 --> 00:17:46.010
You'll get hurt...

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:46.760
What?

00:17:46.980 --> 00:17:49.810
You sound pretty tough, Inuzuka-kun.

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:54.080
You sure have changed since that dragon girl came.

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:57.660
But it looks like she has a sprained ankle right now.

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:00.290
How pitiful, how pitiful!

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:03.180
Thi... This is nothing!

00:18:04.940 --> 00:18:05.600
Stop it.

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:07.450
Huh? What did you say?

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:08.610
You guys...

00:18:08.930 --> 00:18:11.250
Get out of here right now!

00:18:11.850 --> 00:18:13.390
Ya... Yazawa-dono...

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:15.110
She... She's floating...

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:21.800
I attached the anti-gravity device on my shoes while they were ganging up on Inuzuka-san.

00:18:22.270 --> 00:18:24.090
And the holographic device on my back...

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:27.260
She's the real thing!

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:32.380
And these are laser guns that can't be seen with the naked eye.

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:39.380
A... Amazing...

00:18:39.440 --> 00:18:40.890
Serves you right!

00:18:40.980 --> 00:18:42.990
This is what you get if you mess with Yazawa-san!

00:18:44.940 --> 00:18:46.350
As I would expect from Yazawa-san.

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:47.800
That felt great.

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:48.890
I'm sorry...

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:50.620
...that you have to help us.

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:00.570
It's time...

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:02.210
Alone on the roof...

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:04.750
This is the perfect situation for the confession.

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:07.360
Do your best, Yazawa-dono!

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:09.020
I was really surprised earlier.

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:11.970
It felt like you protected me.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:13.320
You really...

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:15.740
...loved my old man, didn't you?

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:20.480
What do you think of me, Inuzuka-san?

00:19:20.980 --> 00:19:22.800
What are they saying?

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:24.280
I can't hear them.

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:26.570
Focus on my ears...

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:30.710
Would you rest in peace if I say I love you?

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:32.130
No, right?

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:36.020
I and my old man are two different persons, after all.

00:19:36.430 --> 00:19:40.640
And I don't want to go as far as lying to you to make you happy.

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:42.270
How should I say this...?

00:19:42.580 --> 00:19:43.270
I...

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:44.150
I...

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:46.820
Is it a good idea to say this...?

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:49.270
That I'm really not good with ghosts...

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:50.900
...and I hate them...

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:55.550
So Inuzuka-san has Momoko-san after all.

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:58.780
I'm sorry.

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:04.090
Ko... Koushi-dono!

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:05.720
Wait... Momoko-chan!

00:20:06.320 --> 00:20:07.540
Yo... You...

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:08.800
Were you looking the whole time?

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:09.300
Yes!

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:10.430
How did it go?

00:20:11.090 --> 00:20:12.190
You guys too!?

00:20:12.780 --> 00:20:13.700
Sorry...

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:15.200
But we were really worried.

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:18.000
Thank you, everyone.

00:20:18.220 --> 00:20:21.360
Thanks to you, I was able to make memories I will never forget.

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:24.680
Things didn't turn out as I have hoped, but I'm satisfied.

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:26.130
Yazawa-dono...

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:28.110
So will you finally rest in peace?

00:20:28.550 --> 00:20:28.920
Eh?

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:30.270
Well... That's...

00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:34.700
We will not forget about you after you go to heaven.

00:20:35.010 --> 00:20:36.360
Yah, me neither.

00:20:36.050 --> 00:20:36.740
Me neither!

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:37.960
Me neither!

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:39.030
Same here!

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:44.810
I guess I have to go to heaven for everyone's sake...

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:50.240
Thank you, Inuzuka-san, Momoko-san, and everyone.

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:52.970
I'm going back to heaven.

00:20:54.130 --> 00:20:55.990
Yazawa-dono!

00:20:56.240 --> 00:20:57.960
I will be reborn...

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:01.130
Not as Yazawa-san, but as Miyazawa Rumi.

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:03.430
And become everyone's friend...

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:05.880
They are kind people...

00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:09.360
They will welcome me with open arms, I'm sure.

00:21:11.900 --> 00:21:13.380
The rain has stopped.

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:16.270
It's a present to Yazawa-dono.

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:25.430
Will they hurry up and go home?

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:27.700
I can't get down like this...

00:21:28.610 --> 00:21:29.390
Miyazawa.

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:30.460
Is she absent?

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:31.460
Miyazawa Rumi.

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:34.010
I can't...

00:21:34.130 --> 00:21:36.770
It's just too embarrassing to talk...

00:21:37.490 --> 00:21:39.310
Geez... say something.

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:41.670
Hey, Kaa-kun.

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:45.090
Is personality that hard to change?

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:46.660
Hey, is it?

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:49.550
That's right, that's right, that's right!

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:56.180
May tonight be...

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:56.180
今夜もしかして

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:56.180
konya moshikashite

